#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Graphical manager for hyprland-tts: engine, voices, language detection and shortcuts.

This is a thin GTK4 / libadwaita skin. It contains no speech, download, voice-cloning or
keybind logic of its own: every action shells out to the ``hyprland-tts`` CLI (``engine``,
``voice``, ``deps``, ``model``, ``keybind``), which stays the single source of truth and
enforces all validation. Short commands run on a worker thread and report through toasts; long
ones (engine and dependency installs) stream their progress lines into a log view and can be
cancelled. See Agent.md for the architecture.
"""

